From ff4b1d0f09a46726f02c95c781083f577f31c579 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: wade <wade.fs@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 7 Jun 2026 16:58:29 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 01/14] Feature: Web IDE Phase 1 - protocol and basic frontend

- Implemented 'request_web_edit' efun to send file contents to web clients.
- Implemented 'is_web_client' efun to detect modern web interface.
- Added 'WriteFile' to the driver to support server-side persistence.
- Refactored 'edit' command to automatically switch to Web IDE mode.
- Integrated a basic text-area editor in the web frontend with Ctrl+S support.
- Updated docs/plan-web-ide.md with scaffolding template roadmap.
